# Docs contract

**Clear is kind, and only the package's truth is clear.**

The contract lives in the repo so it is readable outside Cursor: @docs/DOCS_CONTRACT.md

Read `docs/DOCS_CONTRACT.md` in full before drafting, editing or reviewing any public docs page, draft (`tmp/docs-scratch/`), chapter (`app/lib/docs/articles/`) or snippet. Change the contract only in that file, and only when the user agrees the change.
